	| Description   | Perlic - ${staticProjectName} License2 Description |
	| Product       | DXP Production                              		 |
	| Type          | Production                                  		 |
	| Details       | Host Name: localhost                        		 |
	| Details       | IP Address: 123.45.67.89                    		 |
	| Details       | MAC Address: 0A-1B-2C-3D-4E-5F              		 |
	| Status        | DEACTIVATED                                 		 |
